# Belt and braces. The manual's own guard, its rule set and its deliberately
# poisoned fixtures live in docs-check/ — outside this directory entirely — so
# that nothing which must not be published is here to be published.
#
# This file is what keeps that true if something strays back in: a non-page file
# under docs/ is served as a static asset, so "it is not in the navigation" is
# not the same as "it cannot be fetched".
*.sh
*.py
check/
